<p>Business seat tiers are currently advertised at 5 seats, 10 seats, and 20 seats. The seat limit counts active members together with invitations that have been sent but not yet accepted. For team sizes or arrangements outside these tiers, contact <a href="mailto:support@cybernetai.app">support@cybernetai.app</a>.</p>
